  "scope": "Partial pinned Blender5.3 macOS arm64 CPU compositor static InputRotation EulerXYZ property. Inputs raw positive zero or signed normal Float32 magnitude at most8 radians; every native quaternion output must pass normal/+0 and pre-Float-store hash guards. Scalar RotationToQuaternion endpoints only, bounded typed groups/reroutes; existing VALUE transport. Data-dependent signed-zero output refusals remain. No live ROTATION, normalization, shader/GPU-authored or other version/host credit.",
